{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05700","headline":"杭州北郭戴氏荷池送侯愉 · 崔国辅","name":"杭州北郭戴氏荷池送侯愉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋近万物肃，况当临水时。\n折花赠归客，离绪断荷丝。\n谁谓江国永，故人感在兹。\n道存过北郭，情极望东菑。\n乔木故园意，鸣蝉穷巷悲。\n扁舟竟何待，中路每迟迟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔国辅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05700.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05700","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}